{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "steam-controller-2026",
  "name": "Steam Controller",
  "subtitle": "2026 \"puck\"",

  "_comment": [
    "A LAYOUT is all the widget knows about a controller: a front-view drawing,",
    "the viewBox that drawing is authored in, and where each of hyprpad's logical",
    "controls sits inside it. Adding Xbox / PlayStation / Switch Pro / Steam Deck",
    "is a matter of dropping another file in this directory — Panel.qml reads",
    "every *.json here and never names a controller.",
    "",
    "`art` is tried in order, first hit wins. `steam` resolves against the local",
    "Steam install (STEAM_ROOT, else ~/.local/share/Steam) and is NEVER copied",
    "into this repo — see ../art/LICENSES.md. `bundled` resolves against the",
    "plugin directory and always exists, so the sheet is never artless.",
    "",
    "Control ids are exactly the ones `hyprpad bindings --json` emits in each",
    "entry's `control` field. `x`/`y` are the leader-line anchor in viewBox",
    "coordinates; `side` picks the callout column. `hidden` marks a control a",
    "front view cannot actually show (triggers, grips) so the widget can draw",
    "its leader dashed rather than implying you can see it."
  ],

  "viewBox": { "width": 456, "height": 320 },

  "art": [
    {
      "source": "steam",
      "path": "steamui/images/controller/controller_config_controller_triton.svg",
      "credit": "Valve — read from the local Steam install, never redistributed"
    },
    {
      "source": "bundled",
      "path": "art/steam-controller-2026.svg",
      "credit": "hyprpad's own schematic"
    }
  ],

