  "_glyphs_comment": [
    "The chip drawn at the head of each callout. `image` is a path inside the",
    "plugin — here Kenney's CC0 Input Prompts (art/kenney/LICENSE.txt) — and",
    "`text` is what the widget draws if the file is missing, so a layout that",
    "ships no art at all still reads correctly.",
    "",
    "This map plus `controls` is the whole of what makes a layout controller-",
    "SPECIFIC. A PlayStation layout points the same control ids at Kenney's",
    "ps5_button_cross.svg and friends, a Nintendo one swaps A and B, and",
    "Panel.qml does not change."
  ],
